    "result_text": "Done. The full test suite passes (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 12 tests, 0 failures).\n\nI implemented the `initials` field with two changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field), mirroring the existing `displayName` property.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that computes it: the upper-cased first character of `firstName`, a dot, the upper-cased first character of `lastName`, and a trailing dot \u2014 e.g. `\"john\"` / `\"smith\"` \u2192 `\"J.S.\"`.\n\nThe value is derived on serialization by the mapper (like `displayName`), so it's returned by both `GET /api/owners/{id}` and the create response without any storage changes.",
